他","pubtime":1650078161000,"shixiao":"","puborg":"中国银保监会办公厅","syqt":""}]},"otherfile":{"totalCount":20,"catName":"otherfile","currentNum":10,"listVO":[{"piclinksurl":"","code":"","pcode":"","source":"","title":"到2030年迈上100万亿元台阶！国务院发文推进服务业扩能提质","totalCount":0,"pubtimeStr":"2026.04.21","fwzh":"","imgurl":"","dateType":true,"fwdw":"","theme":false,"currentNum":0,"id":"26017245","themeLinks":[],"ptime":0,"fcode":"","summary":"<em>租赁</em>。鼓励融资<em>租赁</em>企业统筹运用直接<em>租赁</em>、售后回租、联合<em>租赁</em>等服务模式，提供定制化方案，降低承租人运营成本。加强承租人信用状况、还款能力等监测评估，建立健全<em>租赁</em>物价值评估体系。发挥政府性融资担保机构作用","wenhao":"","wjlx":"","index":"","zhengtype":"","personal":false,"gname":"","subjectword":"","url":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/202604/content_7066515.htm","pubtime":1776769560000,"shixiao":"","syqt":""},{"piclinksurl":"","code":"","pcode":"","source":"","title":"国务院1月重要政策","totalCount":0,"pubtimeStr":"2026.01.30","fwzh":"","imgurl":"","dateType":true,"fwdw":"","theme":false,"currentNum":0,"id":"25606603","themeLinks":[],"ptime":0,"fcode":"","summary":"部门：商业用房购房贷款最低首付款比例调整为不低于30% 公租房税收优惠政策延续实施 财政部、税务总局发布《关于延续实施公共<em>租赁</em><em>住房</em>税收优惠政策的公告》，延续实施相关税收优惠政策至2027年12月31日。","wenhao":"","wjlx":"","index":"","zhengtype":"","personal":false,"gname":"","subjectword":"","url":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/202601/content_7056655.htm","pubtime":1769776980000,"shixiao":"","syqt":""},{"piclinksurl":"","code":"","pcode":"","source":"","title":"<em>住房</em><em>租赁</em>新规如何为“安心租住”保驾护航？","totalCount":0,"pubtimeStr":"2025.07.23","fwzh":"","imgurl":"","dateType":true,"fwdw":"","theme":false,"currentNum":0,"id":"24460022","themeLinks":[],"ptime":0,"fcode":"","summary":"新华社北京7月23日电 题：<em>住房</em><em>租赁</em>新规如何为“安心租住”保驾护航？ 新华社记者王优玲 任意中止合同、霸王条款、合同陷阱、虚假房源、<em>押金</em>退还难……我国<em>住房</em><em>租赁</em>市场蓬勃发展，但也出现一些乱象扰乱","wenhao":"","wjlx":"","index":"","zhengtype":"","personal":false,"gname":"","subjectword":"","url":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/202507/content_7033527.htm","pubtime":1753277820000,"shixiao":"","syqt":""},{"piclinksurl":"","code":"","pcode":"","source":"","title":"租到满意房，专门法规来了——《<em>住房</em><em>租赁</em>条例》9月15日起施行","totalCount":0,"pubtimeStr":"2025.07.24","fwzh":"","imgurl":"","dateType":true,"fwdw":"","theme":false,"currentNum":0,"id":"24463398","themeLinks":[],"ptime":0,"fcode":"","summary":"发展<em>住房</em><em>租赁</em>市场是解决<em>住房</em>问题的重要途径。但在生活中，甲醛房、虚假房源、<em>押金</em>退还难等现象，侵害了租户合法权益；擅自改动<em>租赁</em><em>住房</em>结构、私拉乱接管线等行为，也给房东造成困扰，影响了<em>租赁</em>市场的健康发展。","wenhao":"","wjlx":"","index":"","zhengtype":"","personal":false,"gname":"","subjectword":"","url":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/202507/content_7033545.htm","pubtime":1753315620000,"shixiao":"","syqt":""},{"piclinksurl":"","code":"","pcode":"","source":"","title":"租房有新规！国务院出台条例→","totalCount":0,"pubtimeStr":"2025.07.21","fwzh":"","imgurl":"","dateType":true,"fwdw":"","theme":false,"currentNum":0,"id":"24445862","themeLinks":[],"ptime":0,"fcode":"","summary":"<em>租赁</em><em>住房</em>的，予以配合。 收取<em>押金</em>要约定好数额、返还时间等内容 出租人收取<em>押金</em>的，应当在<em>住房</em><em>租赁</em>合同中约定<em>押金</em>的数额、返还时间以及扣减<em>押金</em>的情形等事项。除<em>住房</em><em>租赁</em>合同约定的情形以外，出租人无正当理由不得","wenhao":"","wjlx":"","index":"","zhengtype":"","personal":false,"gname":"","subjectword":"","url":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/202507/content_7032973.htm","pubtime":1753103580000,"shixiao":"","syqt":""},{"piclinksurl":"","code":"","pcode":"","source":"","title":"司法部、<em>住房</em>城乡建设部负责人就《<em>住房</em><em>租赁</em>条例》答记者问","totalCount":0,"pubtimeStr":"2025.07.21","fwzh":"","imgurl":"","dateType":true,"fwdw":"","theme":false,"currentNum":0,"id":"24446006","themeLinks":[],"ptime":0,"fcode":"","summary":"规定<em>住房</em><em>租赁</em>合同应当明确约定<em>押金</em>的数额、返还时间以及扣减<em>押金</em>的情形等事项，出租人无正当理由不得扣减<em>押金</em>；出租人解除<em>住房</em><em>租赁</em>合同应当通知承租人并为承租人腾退<em>租赁</em><em>住房</em>留出合理时间，不得采取暴力、威胁或者","wenhao":"","wjlx":"","index":"","zhengtype":"","personal":false,"gname":"","subjectword":"","url":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/202507/content_7032987.htm","pubtime":1753105920000,"shixiao":"","syqt":""},{"piclinksurl":"","code":